{
  "name": "Google Maps Scraper (Sheets)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "cronExpression": "0 6 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "sched-1",
      "name": "Cada mañana 6:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": "v2",
          "value": "TU_ID_DE_HOJA",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": "v2",
          "value": "Queries",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "gs-read",
      "name": "Leer Queries",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REEMPLAZAR",
          "name": "Google (Sheets)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1
      },
      "id": "split-1",
      "name": "Por query",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        440,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://TU_API_SCRAPER:8080/run",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ query: $json.query, location: $json.location, max_results: $json.max_results ? Number($json.max_results) : 10, search_email: $json.search_email ? String($json.search_email).toLowerCase() !== 'false' : true }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "id": "http-run",
      "name": "Ejecutar scraper",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const out = ($json.results || []).map((r) => ({ json: r }));\nif (out.length === 0) {\n  // sin filas nuevas -> no escribir nada\n  return [];\n}\nreturn out;"
      },
      "id": "to-rows",
      "name": "A filas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        940,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": "v2",
          "value": "TU_ID_DE_HOJA",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": "v2",
          "value": "Results",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "gs-append",
      "name": "Escribir Results",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1160,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REEMPLAZAR",
          "name": "Google (Sheets)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Google Maps Scraper + Sheets\n\n### Flujo\n1. **6:00 AM** trigger\n2. Lee la sheet **Queries** (1 fila por busqueda)\n3. Llama al scraper API (1 query por vez)\n4. Escribe los nuevos en la sheet **Results**\n\n### Cap diario\nEl scraper respeta `MAX_DAILY` (ej. 100). Cuando se alcanza, devuelve `daily_cap_reached` y no escribe mas.\n\n### Configurar (tras importar)\n1. En ambos nodos de Sheets: seleccionar tu **credential Google** y tu **sheet ID**.\n2. En el nodo **Ejecutar scraper**: poner la URL real de la API (ej. `http://google-maps-scraper-api:8080/run`).\n\n### Columnas de la sheet Queries\n`query | location | max_results | search_email`\n\n### Columnas de la sheet Results\n`nombre | rating | reviews | categoria | direccion | telefono | web | email | horario | scraped_at`"
      },
      "id": "note-1",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        60
      ]
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
  "connections": {
    "Cada mañana 6:00": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Leer Queries",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Leer Queries": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Por query",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Por query": {
      "main": [
        [],
        [
          {
            "node": "Ejecutar scraper",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Ejecutar scraper": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "A filas",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "A filas": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Escribir Results",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Escribir Results": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Por query",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionTimeout": 7200,
    "saveExecutionProgress": true,
    "saveDataErrorExecution": "all",
    "saveDataSuccessExecution": "all",
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "instanceId": "google-maps-scraper-sheets"
  },
  "id": "google-maps-scraper-sheets",
  "tags": []
}
